  <note opaque="true" posX="80" posY="40" sizeHeight="241" sizeWidth="681" text="After the tMap, the output field label is fill by:&#xD;&#xA;                              DemoRoutines.getLabel(row1.value)&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;A filter DemoRoutines.getFilter(row1.value ,row1.value2) return a booleen&#xD;&#xA;        to define if the row must be skip, or must be send to the tLogRow&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;        DemoRoutines.getFilter(i,i2) return true if i &lt; i2 and false else.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;This 2 methods are defined on the DemoRoutines (Repository/Code/Routines)">
